    <string name="about_window_text">\"Ad-silence\" silences ads on Accuradio, Spotify, Spotify-Lite, Tidal, Pandora, Soundcloud, and any user-configured apps. It works by utilizing notifications posted by these apps. Only notifications from these apps are accessed for identification and discarded immediately.         <![CDATA[This app is OpenSource. You can check the full source code on GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence/">https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence/</a>]]>
        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>

        <![CDATA[<b>
        Designed to be minimal &amp; lightweight, ~150KB.</b>]]>

        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>

        <![CDATA[<b>
        If you face issues or want a new feature, kindly open an issue on GitHub.</b>]]>

        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>

        <![CDATA[<b>
        SECURITY WARNING: Only install from GitHub, Google Play, or F-Droid. Bad actors can modify the code from other sources to read your notifications. If you got this from elsewhere, uninstall it immediately!</b>]]>

        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>
        Made by <![CDATA[ <a href="https://github.com/aghontpi">aghontpi&lt;bluepie&gt;</a>]]> for OpenSource.
